      "comment" : "Last line of the sheet “Sign in to %@ with a passkey?” on a Mac with Touch ID. “Use Passkey” is the title of the sheet’s default button; keep it the same."
    },
    "Unload Tab" : {
      "comment" : "Releases a tab's web content without removing its sidebar link or pin. Menu command and tooltip for sidebar minus/X controls, and the File menu item (⌘W) while the tab is pinned."
    },
    "Unload Folder Tabs" : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip and accessibility label for the X beside a sidebar folder's item count. Unloads its nested tabs while retaining links, pins and the folder."
    },
