    "Every provider you’ve set up." : {

    },
    "Every website asks the first time." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Ask option for a permission's default, meaning each website raises its own request. Third person singular."
    },
    "every website you visit" : {
      "comment" : "The one entry that can appear in place of website names in the bulleted list of the extension install confirmation dialog, used when the extension can reach every website. It appears after a bullet character supplied by the app, so it is a phrase rather than a sentence and takes no full stop."
    },
    "Exit Full Screen" : {
      "comment" : "Command that leaves full screen; the same command reads “Enter Full Screen” while the window is not full screen. Use Apple’s own wording for the standard macOS command."
