    "Hide tab titles in the sidebar to save space. The Minimal window always shows them." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the Icons only switch in Appearance settings, and its Settings search description. With the switch on, the Standard window’s sidebar keeps each website icon and drops the tab title, so it takes less room. The Minimal window’s list of tabs is not affected, which the second sentence says; the switch is dimmed while that window style is chosen."
