    "posts or sends something in your name" : {
      "comment" : "Clause that completes the sentence This … and usually can’t be undone. in the dialog asking the user to approve an action the assistant wants to take. Lowercase, third person singular; the implied subject is the action, and in your name means as though the user had done it."
