    },
    "Remove Extension" : {
      "comment" : "Destructive command that uninstalls a browser extension. It is the confirming button in the dialog, the command in the right-click menu of the extension's toolbar button, and the last item in the ellipsis menu of its row in Settings > Extensions. Title Case, imperative verb plus object."
    },
