    },
    "Suggested" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the group of recommended models at the top of the model pop-up menu. Adjective describing the models below it."
    },
    "Suggestions" : {
      "comment" : "Two uses. The name of the Suggestions section of the start page. And the accessibility label, hidden on screen, of the segmented control that switches the Suggested Merges sheet between suggested and dismissed groups."
