    "Version %@ is available. Installing restarts WSurf." : {
      "comment" : "Status line under the Software Update heading in Settings when a newer release exists. %@ is the new version number, e.g. 1.4.2. The second sentence is the only warning the user gets: the Install button does not ask again."
    },
    "Video and audio may start playing as soon as a page loads." : {
      "comment" : "Caption for the most permissive choice of the Autoplay setting, describing what that choice allows websites to do."
    },
    "Video from a tab you leave moves into the sidebar player." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the Show video in the player row on the Experiments settings page, and the caption of that same row in Settings search. The video only moves while the user is on a different tab, and turning this row on turns the Automatic Picture in Picture row off. “Picture in Picture” is the macOS name of the floating video window — use the system’s own wording. Two full sentences."
    },
    "Video keeps playing in a floating window when you leave its tab." : {
