    "Archived Tabs" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the ⌘K palette section that lists tabs WSurf closed automatically because they sat unused, and the label of the chip in the palette field while only those tabs are searched. Choosing a row opens the tab again. Plural noun phrase, Title Case."
