    },
    "Weak" : {
      "comment" : "Filter chip in the Vault tab of Settings › Credentials, with a count after it: logins whose saved password is weak. Shown only while one is. Also the small orange badge on the row of such a login. An adjective; one word, tight."
    },
    "Weak password" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of the orange Weak badge on a login’s row in Settings › Credentials: its saved password is weak. A noun phrase."
